"""packs/english_lang.py — the English language, linguistics and communication pack.

Covers: English Language, English Studies, Linguistics, Communication Skills,
Use of English and every course routed to the language discipline.

Every atom teaches real language science: the IPA and vowel-consonant systems,
stress and intonation, free and bound morphemes, inflection versus derivation,
phrase and clause structure, the tense-aspect system, concord rules,
synonymy and hyponymy, comprehension and inference, summary technique, essay
architecture, formal correspondence, register variation, Nigerian English,
code-switching, discourse and rhetoric. Quiz items test real grammar
judgements with unambiguous keys. The {S} slot serves every course of the
discipline, from English studies to communication skills.
"""

